# Keycloak auth rules

Detail: `knowledge/auth-keycloak.md`. Why: ADR-0021 · ADR-0040.

- Use skill `keycloak-auth` for **client** SSO — do not freestyle password/JWT stacks in the UI.
- Soft-bypass only when Keycloak triad (`VITE_KEYCLOAK_*`) incomplete.
- Server-side JWT verify / `owner_id` scoping live in the **separate API repo**.
